      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "So, the whole chain. We declared a Certificate, and cert-manager noticed it."
        },
        {
          "text": "It made a new private key, and a CertificateRequest for it."
        },
        {
          "text": "The ClusterIssuer signed it with the intermediate CA, and cert-manager stored the result in golinks-tls."
        },
        {
          "text": "Traefik watches Secrets, so it started serving the new certificate straight away.",
          "pauseAfter": 0.4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "curl",
      "type": "terminal",
      "title": "laptop",
      "steps": [
        {
          "at": 0,
          "command": "curl -sv https://go.corp.internal/standup 2>&1 | grep -E 'Alt|iss|exp|ok|< H'",
          "output": [
            "*  expire date: Jan 31 15:31:07 2027 GMT",
            "*  subjectAltName: host \"go.corp.internal\" matched cert's \"go.corp.internal\"",
            "*  issuer: O=Corp; CN=Corp k3s Intermediate CA",
            "*  SSL certificate verify ok.",
            "< HTTP/2 404"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Now from a laptop. curl's verbose output, filtered down to the lines about the certificate."
        },
        {
          "text": "Good until the end of January, for go.corp.internal, issued by the cluster's intermediate CA."
        },
        {
          "text": "Verify ok. Traefik sent the intermediate along with the certificate, so the laptop could follow the chain up to the company root it already trusts."
        },
        {
          "text": "And still a 404: there's no standup link yet. Creating one needs sign-in, in Episode 9. But even this 404 came back encrypted, from a server the laptop could check."
        },
        {
          "text": "Anything else that calls go over HTTPS, a pod included, needs the company root in its trust store too.",
          "pauseAfter": 0.4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana-yaml",
      "type": "code",
      "file": "manifests/logging/grafana.yaml",
      "range": [
        15,
        38
      ],
      "highlights": [
        {
          "at": 0,
          "lines": [
            26,
            30
          ]
        },
        {
          "at": 1,
          "lines": [
            31,
            34
          ]
        },
        {
          "at": 2,
          "lines": [
            35,
            38
          ]
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Grafana's Ingress comes from its chart, so we don't write a Certificate for it."
        },
        {
          "text": "We add one annotation instead. cert-manager watches Ingresses too, and this one names the issuer to use.",
          "senses": {
            "use": "verb"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "With the TLS section, that's enough: cert-manager makes the Certificate itself, named after the Secret."
        },
        {
